pageType: final
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$primary"
elements:
  - elementId: final-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [140, 120, 1000, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 36
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>总结与讨论</strong></p>
  - elementId: final-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [580, 195, 120, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: conclusion-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [120, 220, 1040, 100]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF15"
  - elementId: conclusion-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [140, 225, 1000, 90]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong>核心结论：</strong>在受控 RISC-V Linux workload 下，可以从 CVA6/Genesys2 硬件 trace 重建 source-labeled behavior；当前证据支持 controlled behavior reconstruction，不支持 real malware detection accuracy。</p>
        <p><strong>关键创新：</strong>RTL-level committed behavior trace + 明确的证据来源标记 + 分阶段 artifact-backed validation。</p>
  - elementId: question-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [140, 340, 1000, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$accent"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>需要导师帮助判断的问题</strong></p>
  - elementId: q1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [140, 380, 1000, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "#FFFFFFCC"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>1.</strong> 当前主 claim 的 scope 和边界是否适合作为论文方向？</p>
  - elementId: q2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [140, 445, 1000, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "#FFFFFFCC"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>2.</strong> 是否需要优先补齐 board-native benign control 或 full pointer string 证据？</p>
  - elementId: q3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [140, 510, 1000, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "#FFFFFFCC"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>3.</strong> 论文投稿目标应定位 CCF-A 会议还是更务实的 workshop？</p>
  - elementId: thankyou
    elementType: text
    bounds: [140, 600, 1000, 50]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>谢谢！欢迎提问</p>
